Prefecture University, and provided to us by Dr. Ben
Dunn, University of Florida, and Dr. J. Kay, University
of Wales.&lt;/PDBx:details&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:genus&gt;Actinomycetes&lt;/PDBx:genus&gt;
