   <xsd:complexType name="pdbx_initial_refinement_modelType">
      <xsd:annotation>
         <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
Data items in the pdbx_initial_refinement_model record the starting model(s) used in structure determination.

    Example 1 - hypothetical example
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_initial_refinement_modelCategory&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:pdbx_initial_refinement_model id=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:accession_code&gt;3LTQ&lt;/PDBx:accession_code&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:entity_id_list&gt;1&lt;/PDBx:entity_id_list&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:source_name&gt;PDB&lt;/PDBx:source_name&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:type&gt;experimental model&lt;/PDBx:type&gt;
   &lt;/PDBx:pdbx_initial_refinement_model&gt;
&lt;/PDBx:pdbx_initial_refinement_modelCategory&gt;


         </xsd:documentation>
      </xsd:annotation>
      <xsd:sequence>
         <xsd:element name="pdbx_initial_refinement_model" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
            <xsd:complexType>
               <xsd:all>
                  <xsd:element name="accession_code" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1" nillable="true" type="xsd:string">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
This item identifies an accession code of the resource where the initial model
is used
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="details" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1" nillable="true" type="xsd:string">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
A description of special aspects of the initial model
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="entity_id_list" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1" nillable="true" type="xsd:string">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
A comma separated list of entities reflecting the initial model used for refinement
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="source_name" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1" nillable="true">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
This item identifies the resource of initial model used for refinement
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                     <xsd:simpleType>
                        <xsd:restriction base="xsd:string">
                           <xsd:enumeration value="PDB" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="AlphaFold" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="Robetta" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="RoseTTAFold" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="ModelAngelo" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="ModelArchive" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="SwissModel" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="Modeller" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="ITasser" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="PDB-Dev" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="PHYRE" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="InsightII" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="Other" />
                        </xsd:restriction>
                     </xsd:simpleType>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="type" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
This item describes the type of the initial model was generated
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                     <xsd:simpleType>
                        <xsd:restriction base="xsd:string">
                           <xsd:enumeration value="in silico model" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="experimental model" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="integrative model" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="other" />
                        </xsd:restriction>
                     </xsd:simpleType>
                  </xsd:element>
               </xsd:all>
               <xsd:attribute name="id" use="required" type="xsd:integer">
                  <xsd:annotation>
                     <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
A unique identifier for the starting model record.
                     </xsd:documentation>
                  </xsd:annotation>
               </xsd:attribute>
            </xsd:complexType>
         </xsd:element>
      </xsd:sequence>
   </xsd:complexType>

   <xsd:complexType name="pdbx_investigationType">
      <xsd:annotation>
         <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
The PDBX_INVESTIGATION category provides a information of an investigation associated with this file.

    Example 1
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_investigationCategory&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:pdbx_investigation id=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:resource_accession&gt;FRAG_001&lt;/PDBx:resource_accession&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:resource_name&gt;PDB&lt;/PDBx:resource_name&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:type&gt;Fragment Screening&lt;/PDBx:type&gt;
   &lt;/PDBx:pdbx_investigation&gt;
&lt;/PDBx:pdbx_investigationCategory&gt;


         </xsd:documentation>
      </xsd:annotation>
      <xsd:sequence>
         <xsd:element name="pdbx_investigation" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
            <xsd:complexType>
               <xsd:all>
                  <xsd:element name="details" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1" nillable="true" type="xsd:string">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
Additional details relevant to the investigation.
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="resource_accession" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1" type="xsd:string">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
The accession used to identify this investigation
FRAG_001
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="resource_name" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
The name of the resource archiving this investigation
PDB
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                     <xsd:simpleType>
                        <xsd:restriction base="xsd:string">
                           <xsd:enumeration value="PDB" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="BMRB" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="EMDB" />
                        </xsd:restriction>
                     </xsd:simpleType>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="type" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
Describes the type of investigation.
Fragment Screening
                        </xsd:documentation>
                     </xsd:annotation>
                     <xsd:simpleType>
                        <xsd:restriction base="xsd:string">
                           <xsd:enumeration value="Fragment Screening" />
                           <xsd:enumeration value="Crystallization Screening" />
                        </xsd:restriction>
                     </xsd:simpleType>
                  </xsd:element>
               </xsd:all>
               <xsd:attribute name="id" use="required" type="xsd:string">
                  <xsd:annotation>
                     <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
Uniquely identifies an investigation
1
                     </xsd:documentation>
                  </xsd:annotation>
               </xsd:attribute>
            </xsd:complexType>
         </xsd:element>
      </xsd:sequence>
   </xsd:complexType>

   <xsd:complexType name="pdbx_ion_infoType">
      <xsd:annotation>
         <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
Data items in the PDBX_ION_INFO category are still used until
the &apos;entity&apos; categories are entered into the database, even though the
information is repeated.

    Example 1 - based on NDB entry DDH048
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_ion_infoCategory&gt;
