    Example 1 -
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_struct_assembly_genCategory&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:pdbx_struct_assembly_gen assembly_id=&quot;1&quot; asym_id_list=&quot;A&quot; oper_expression=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/PDBx:pdbx_struct_assembly_gen&gt;
