                  <xsd:element name="space_group_name_Hall" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1" nillable="true" type="xsd:string">
                     <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation xml:lang="en">
Space-group symbol as described by Hall (1981). This symbol
